      "writtenOn": "2024-10-28T20:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Run test on a physical or virtual device with shell scripts:\n  $ kernel/tests/tools/run_test_only.sh -t kunit -s \u003cserial_number\u003e\n\nTo launch a virtual device before running the test, you can use :\n  $ kernel/tests/tools/launch_cvd.sh\n\nAfter running the test, you can use the following command to remove the virtual device.\n  $ prebuilts/asuite/acloud/linux-x86/acloud delete",
